      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I feel weak, we've been here before",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "'Cause I feel we keep going back and forth",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Maybe it's over, maybe we're through",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I honestly can say I still love you",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Maybe we reached the mountain peak",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And there's no more left to climb",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And maybe we lost the magic piece",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And we're both too blind to find",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Let's start over",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Let's give love their wings",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
