          "text": "Let's start over",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Stop fighting 'bout the same old thing",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Let's start over",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "We can't let our good love die",
